+    <div class="account-layout">
+      <aside class="coffee-panel">
+        <div class="coffee-copy"><span class="small-label">THE DAILY GRIND CLUB</span><h2>Less to remember.<br>More to savor.</h2><p>Your favorite coffee is worth remembering.<br>Another password? We don’t think so.</p></div>
+        <div class="photo-caption"><span class="caption-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div>Crafted with care.<br><span>From our beans to your peace of mind.</span></div></div>
+      </aside>
+      <section id="loading" class="account-panel"><p>Getting your account ready…</p></section>
+      <section id="guest" class="account-panel" hidden aria-labelledby="guest-title">
+        <div class="round-icon" aria-hidden="true">♧</div><p class="eyebrow">MAKE YOURSELF AT HOME</p><h2 id="guest-title">Welcome to the club.</h2><p class="muted">One less password between you and your daily ritual.</p>
+        <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Account access"><button role="tab" id="signin-tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="signin-panel">Sign in</button><button role="tab" id="signup-tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="signup-panel" tabindex="-1">Create an account</button></div>
+        <div id="signin-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="signin-tab">
+          <form id="signin-form"><label for="login-name">Username <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label><input id="login-name" name="username" autocomplete="username webauthn" placeholder="Your Daily Grind username"><button class="primary full" type="submit" data-passkey><span aria-hidden="true">⌘</span> Sign in with a passkey <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></form>
+          <p class="hint">Use your fingerprint, face, device PIN, or security key. Your device will help you choose your account.</p>
+        </div>
+        <div id="signup-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="signup-tab" hidden>
+          <form id="signup-form"><label for="display-name">Your name</label><input id="display-name" name="displayName" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="How should we call you?"><label for="username">Choose a username</label><input id="username" name="username" autocomplete="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="40" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9._\-]{2,39}" aria-describedby="username-help" placeholder="e.g. morning.person"><p id="username-help" class="field-help">3–40 letters, numbers, dots, dashes, or underscores.</p><button type="submit" class="primary full" data-passkey>Create account with a passkey <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></form>
+          <p class="hint">No password needed. Save your passkey when your device asks, and you’re in.</p>
+        </div>
+        <div class="security-note"><span class="shield" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><strong>A safer kind of sign-in.</strong><p>Your fingerprint and face stay on your device. We never see or store them.</p></div></div>
+      </section>
+      <section id="member" class="account-panel member-panel" hidden aria-labelledby="member-title">
+        <p class="eyebrow">YOUR CORNER OF THE CAFÉ</p><h2 id="member-title">Welcome back.</h2><p class="muted">A little peace of mind, on the house.</p>
+        <div class="section-heading"><div><h3>Your passkeys <span id="key-count" class="count">0</span></h3><p class="hint">Secure sign-in, wherever your day takes you.</p></div><button id="add-key" class="secondary" data-passkey>+ Add passkey</button></div>
+        <div id="key-list" class="key-list"></div>
+        <p class="field-help">Keep a second passkey on another device or security key so you always have a way back in.</p>
+        <div class="profile-heading"><h3>Account details</h3><span id="verified-badge" class="badge">Identity protected</span></div>
+        <form id="profile-form"><div class="form-grid"><div><label for="profile-name">Your name</label><input id="profile-name" name="displayName" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="80"></div><div><label for="profile-username">Username</label><input id="profile-username" name="username" autocomplete="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="40" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9._\-]{2,39}"></div></div><div class="profile-actions"><button class="secondary" type="submit">Save changes</button><button class="text-button" id="verify-identity" type="button" data-passkey>Verify identity with a passkey</button></div></form>
+        <p class="hint">We’ll ask you to verify your identity before sensitive changes.</p>
